     4894   Filter-Block:
     4895   DO ON STOP    UNDO Filter-Block, LEAVE Filter-Block
     4896       ON ERROR   UNDO Filter-Block, LEAVE Filter-Block
     4897       ON END-KEY UNDO Filter-Block, LEAVE Filter-Block :
